# Minimal-Cluster for fast single-test iteration.
# Only top-level scenarios; postgres is snapshotted automatically as a
# transient dep CT for each variant (default/ssl/mtls).
#
# Usage:
#   pnpm tsx backend/tests/livetests/src/live-test-runner.mts yellow @e2e/snapshot-baseline.lst
zitadel/default
zitadel/ssl
zitadel/mtls
zitadel/mtls-certonly
